      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
    {
      "id": "el-825687893",
      "x": 996,
      "y": 1152,
      "width": 565.9599999999999,
      "height": 185.90000000000003,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 714850270,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 874010966,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789636770582,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Compile: FUSE_BETA=1, FUSE_GAMMA not defined.\ndo_gamma=false, do_beta=true\n\n1. NCRISC pushes \u03b2 into dfb::beta  (this part is fine)\n2. TRISC scale packs N tiles into dfb::x, push_back, wait_front on x\n3. #ifdef FUSE_GAMMA is compiled out \u2014 nobody push_back\u2019s fusion\n4. TRISC hits dfb_outgamma.wait_front(N) where outgamma = fusion\n   available = 0  \u2192  infinite wait. Device hang / watcher timeout.\n\nRMSNORM: fusion was never touched at all.\nlayer_norm: fusion==xmm, already popped after scale, still empty for beta.",
      "originalText": "Compile: FUSE_BETA=1, FUSE_GAMMA not defined.\ndo_gamma=false, do_beta=true\n\n1. NCRISC pushes \u03b2 into dfb::beta  (this part is fine)\n2. TRISC scale packs N tiles into dfb::x, push_back, wait_front on x\n3. #ifdef FUSE_GAMMA is compiled out \u2014 nobody push_back\u2019s fusion\n4. TRISC hits dfb_outgamma.wait_front(N) where outgamma = fusion\n   available = 0  \u2192  infinite wait. Device hang / watcher timeout.\n\nRMSNORM: fusion was never touched at all.\nlayer_norm: fusion==xmm, already popped after scale, still empty for beta.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
