      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "F. Fix  (do this; do not copy the issue one-liner blindly)",
      "originalText": "F. Fix  (do this; do not copy the issue one-liner blindly)",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
    {
      "id": "el-295382555",
      "x": 996,
      "y": 1392,
      "width": 528.26,
      "height": 219.70000000000002,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2b8a3e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 428542812,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 876226868,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789636770582,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Keep scale packing into dfb_im (ex_sqr / x) when \u03b2 is present.\nChange only the beta CONSUMER:\n\n    constexpr uint32_t dfb_beta_src = do_gamma ? dfb_fusion : dfb_im;\n\nwait / add_tiles_bcast_rows / pop  \u2192  dfb_beta_src\n\n\u03b3+\u03b2:  gamma wrote fusion, beta reads fusion     (unchanged)\n\u03b2 only: scale wrote x, beta reads x              (fixes hang)\n\u03b3 only: FUSE_BETA compiled out\n\nIssue one-liner (pack scale into fusion) is OK for RMSNORM,\nunsafe for layer_norm because fusion aliases live xmm.",
      "originalText": "Keep scale packing into dfb_im (ex_sqr / x) when \u03b2 is present.\nChange only the beta CONSUMER:\n\n    constexpr uint32_t dfb_beta_src = do_gamma ? dfb_fusion : dfb_im;\n\nwait / add_tiles_bcast_rows / pop  \u2192  dfb_beta_src\n\n\u03b3+\u03b2:  gamma wrote fusion, beta reads fusion     (unchanged)\n\u03b2 only: scale wrote x, beta reads x              (fixes hang)\n\u03b3 only: FUSE_BETA compiled out\n\nIssue one-liner (pack scale into fusion) is OK for RMSNORM,\nunsafe for layer_norm because fusion aliases live xmm.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
