      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "BRISC   kernels/dataflow/reader_mcast_{sender,receiver}_unary_sharded_ln_post_allgather.cpp\nNCRISC  kernels/dataflow/writer_unary_sharded_ln.cpp   (or writer_unary_sharded_ln_rm_gb.cpp)\nTRISC   kernels/compute/layernorm_sharded_post_allgather.cpp     \u2190 item 4 lives here\nHOST    sharded_layernorm_factory_helpers.cpp   RISCV_0=reader, RISCV_1=writer\n        FUSE_GAMMA / FUSE_BETA from has_gamma / has_beta independently\n\nTest must use LayerNormShardedMultiCoreProgramConfig + weight=None + bias=.\nInterleaved DRAM bias-only test does NOT hit this kernel.",
      "originalText": "BRISC   kernels/dataflow/reader_mcast_{sender,receiver}_unary_sharded_ln_post_allgather.cpp\nNCRISC  kernels/dataflow/writer_unary_sharded_ln.cpp   (or writer_unary_sharded_ln_rm_gb.cpp)\nTRISC   kernels/compute/layernorm_sharded_post_allgather.cpp     \u2190 item 4 lives here\nHOST    sharded_layernorm_factory_helpers.cpp   RISCV_0=reader, RISCV_1=writer\n        FUSE_GAMMA / FUSE_BETA from has_gamma / has_beta independently\n\nTest must use LayerNormShardedMultiCoreProgramConfig + weight=None + bias=.\nInterleaved DRAM bias-only test does NOT hit this kernel.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
